- when is the snapshot emitted (every step? only when the last claimed message is a user message?)
- what's in it (time, cwd, recent events, token usage...)

Also the question "会发送persona+上下文注入吗" — after tool call, the request would be: system = renderPrompt(assembly) (persona + sections + tools), messages = derived history (user msg, assistant tool-call, tool result, + possibly context snapshot message). So yes, persona is always in system, and the context snapshot rides as a user message in the same request.

